    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a new player that doesn't know how each piece moves? Have you ever made a move, not realizing you have left an important piece wide open for attack? Have you ever missed opportunities to checkmate your opponent? With this version of Chess, you can easily survey every move possible and what effects it will have. The game will not provide strategy recommendations, but will give you the ability to survey and judge every possible move for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To report bugs or request changes, go to the ChessVisualized-Info repository on GitHub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Known bugs:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkmate moves have a small chance of appearing as stalemate moves. Making these moves will not trigger the victory message.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check moves have a small chance of appearing as normal moves.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a new player that doesn't know how each piece moves? Have you ever made a move, not realizing you have left an important piece wide open for attack? Have you ever missed opportunities to checkmate your opponent? With this version of Chess, you can easily survey every move possible and what effects it will have. The game will not provide strategy recommendations, but will give you the ability to survey and judge every possible move for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To report bugs or request changes, go to the ChessVisualized-Info repository on GitHub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Known bugs:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkmate moves have a small chance of appearing as stalemate moves. Making these moves will not trigger the victory message.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check moves have a small chance of appearing as normal moves.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A playable Chess board that visualizes where each piece can go and what every move does",
